...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
budget: BudgetAnalysisAgent { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }

user -> ui: 소득·지출·부채 입력 + 분석 버튼
ui -> budget: analyze_finances → Runner.run_async 1번째
budget -> gemini: 모델 호출 (BudgetAnalysis 스키마)
gemini -> budget: JSON 응답 → state.budget_analysis
